---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---
<Base
  title={`Privacy policy | ${site.name}`}
  description="What data this site collects and how it is used."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <div class="article-page">
    <Header />
    <main class="static-main">
      <p class="static-eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p>
        <em>
          TODO before launch: confirm which analytics, ad network and newsletter
          provider you actually use, then delete the ones that do not apply. An
          inaccurate privacy policy is worse than a short one — and ad networks
          check this page during review.
        </em>
      </p>

      <h2>What is collected</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics.</strong> Aggregate visit data — pages viewed, referrer,
          approximate region, device type. No attempt is made to identify you.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Newsletter.</strong> If you subscribe, your email address is stored
          by the newsletter provider solely to send the newsletter. Unsubscribe at any
          time using the link in every email.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Advertising.</strong> Third-party ad networks may set cookies or use
          device identifiers to serve and measure ads. Their use of that data is
          governed by their own privacy policies.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What is never collected</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not ask for and does not want your Social Security number,
        taxpayer identification number, bank or account numbers, income figures, or
        any other tax or financial detail. Do not send that information by email
        either.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are used for analytics and, where ads are shown, by ad networks. You
        can block or delete cookies in your browser; the site still works without
        them.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or
        delete personal data held about you, and to opt out of the sale or sharing
        of personal information. To make a request, use the contact route listed on
        the <a href="/about/">About</a> page.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This site is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly
        collect their personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        This policy will be updated if the tools behind the site change. The date of
        the current version is shown in the site footer.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</Base>
